{
  "info": {
    "name": "Valliu - Red de Recarga",
    "_postman_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
    "description": "Colección de endpoints relacionados con la consola de Red de Recarga de Valliu (`/back-office/recargar`) y el flujo básico de autenticación.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Auth - Login (Sanctum Token)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"usuario@ejemplo.com\",\n  \"password\": \"********\",\n  \"device_name\": \"postman\"\n}\n"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_uri}}/sanctum/token",
              "host": [
                "{{api_uri}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "sanctum",
                "token"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Obtiene un token de acceso (Sanctum) para usar en el resto de endpoints.\n\nBasado en la configuración Angular:\n- authentication.token = `sanctum/token`"
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// Guarda el token en la variable de entorno auth_token",
                  "pm.environment.set(\"auth_token\", pm.response.text());"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Auth - Usuario actual (user)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_uri}}/user",
              "host": [
                "{{api_uri}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "user"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Devuelve los datos del usuario autenticado.\n\nConfiguración Angular:\n- authentication.user = `user`\n\nEl front almacena esta respuesta en `localStorage['user']` para decidir menús, sucursal (BranchId), etc."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Red de Recarga - Consola principal",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Recharge - Listar recargas",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_uri}}/recharge-card?page={{page}}",
              "host": [
                "{{api_uri}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "recharge-card"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "{{page}}",
                  "disabled": false
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lista de recargas de la red de recarga.\n\nBasado en Angular:\n- environment.recharge.api_resource = `recharge-card`\n- `RechargeService.index(page)` hace GET a `${uri}/recharge-card?page=...`.\n\nRespuesta esperada: estructura paginada con `data`, `meta` y `translate_fillable`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Recharge - Crear recarga",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"card_id\": 123,\n  \"amount\": 5000,\n  \"branch_id\": 1,\n  \"payment_method_id\": 2\n}\n"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_uri}}/recharge-card",
              "host": [
                "{{api_uri}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "recharge-card"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Crea una nueva recarga.\n\nBasado en Angular:\n- `RechargeService.store()` hace POST a `${uri}/recharge-card`.\n\nLos campos concretos deben ajustarse a la estructura del modelo de recarga en el backend (usar como ejemplo y verificar con respuestas reales)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Recharge - Ver detalle de recarga",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_uri}}/recharge-card/{{recharge_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{api_uri}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "recharge-card",
                "{{recharge_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Obtiene el detalle de una recarga específica.\n\nBasado en Angular:\n- `RechargeService.show(id)` hace GET a `${uri}/recharge-card/{id}`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Recharge - Actualizar recarga",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"id\": {{recharge_id}},\n  \"amount\": 6000\n}\n"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_uri}}/recharge-card/{{recharge_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{api_uri}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "recharge-card",
                "{{recharge_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Actualiza una recarga existente.\n\nBasado en Angular:\n- `RechargeService.update(recharge)` hace PUT a `${uri}/recharge-card/{id}`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Recharge - Eliminar recarga",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_uri}}/recharge-card/{{recharge_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{api_uri}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "recharge-card",
                "{{recharge_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Elimina una recarga.\n\nBasado en Angular:\n- `RechargeService.delete(id)` hace DELETE a `${uri}/recharge-card/{id}`.\n\nLa UI muestra una notificación de éxito cuando esta operación se completa."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "MyCards - Saldo por sucursal (branch_id)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_uri}}/my-cards?branch_id={{branch_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{api_uri}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "my-cards"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "branch_id",
                  "value": "{{branch_id}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Obtiene el saldo asociado a la sucursal actual.\n\nBasado en Angular:\n- environment.my_card.api_resource = `my-cards`\n- `RechargeComponent.RechargeBalance()` llama a `MyCardService.index(params)` con `branch_id` de `localStorage['BranchId']`.\n\nLa consola usa el primer elemento de `data` (`data[0].balance`) para mostrar el saldo formateado en la vista."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Recharge - Buscar recargas (base-search)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_uri}}/base-search?page={{page}}&query={{query}}",
              "host": [
                "{{api_uri}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "base-search"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "{{page}}",
                  "disabled": false
                },
                {
                  "key": "query",
                  "value": "{{query}}",
                  "disabled": false
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Búsqueda paginada de recargas u otros recursos según la configuración del backend.\n\nBasado en Angular:\n- environment.base.api_search = `base-search`\n- `SearchRechargeService.search(term, page)` hace GET a `${uri}/base-search?page=...&query=...`.\n\nEl resultado se usa para poblar la tabla de la consola de recarga cuando se realiza una búsqueda."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Ventas PAX QR (Gateway)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Gateway - Listar productos QR",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_uri}}/gateway/v1/products?page={{page}}",
              "host": [
                "{{api_uri}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "gateway",
                "v1",
                "products"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "{{page}}",
                  "disabled": false
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lista catálogo de productos/tarifas para Ventas PAX QR.\n\nBasado en Angular:\n- environment.gateway.api_index_product = `gateway/v1/products`\n- `SaleQrService.index(page)` hace GET a `${uri}/gateway/v1/products`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Gateway - Comprar / generar QR (1 unidad)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"product_id\": \"{{product_id}}\"\n}\n"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_uri}}/gateway/v1/purchases",
              "host": [
                "{{api_uri}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "gateway",
                "v1",
                "purchases"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Registra una compra PAX QR y devuelve datos del QR generado.\n\nBasado en Angular:\n- environment.gateway.api_purchase_product = `gateway/v1/purchases`\n- `SaleQrService.sendSaleQR(productId)` hace POST con `{ product_id }`.\n\nNota: en la UI se ejecuta una llamada por cada unidad de cantidad (N llamadas secuenciales)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://api-valliu.test"
    },
    {
      "key": "api_uri",
      "value": "{{base_url}}/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "auth_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "branch_id",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "page",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "recharge_id",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "query",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "product_id",
      "value": ""
    }
  ]
}

